      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad release",
          "heading": "France release 14 players to Top 14 and name five final reservists",
          "body": "The five reservists for Sunday's final against South Africa are Moses Alo Emile, Esteban Capilla, Guillaume Cramont, Paul Graou and Thomas Laclayat, leaving Bayonne without Capilla and Cramont against Castres. The 14 cut loose midweek are all free for round 10 of the Top 14. Rodrigue Neti and Joshua Brennan were already training with Toulouse on Wednesday, Gaël Dréan and Mathis Ferté could boost Toulon at Clermont, and Nicolas Depoortère can line up for Bordeaux-Bègles against Montpellier."
        },
